---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Motion from '../components/Motion.astro';
import { appLoginUrl, appPrivacyUrl, appRegisterUrl, appTermsUrl } from '../lib/app';
import { contactMailto } from '../lib/contact';
import { NAV_LINKS } from '../lib/nav';
import '../styles/home.css';

// "the call", 2 November 2026. Playback starts where the BHP discussion begins (10:37).
const EPISODE_VIDEO_URL =
	'https://d3ocr0urz6zrlt.cloudfront.net/001f6503-160d-4b8d-8ba2-0fa0b86c1001/vimondio_video_1920x1080_10000.mp4';
const EPISODE_START_SECONDS = 10 * 60 + 37;
const EPISODE_TITLE = 'the call, 2 November 2026: BHP discussion on ausbiz';
---

<Layout>
<Motion />
<header class="header"><div class="wrap navrow"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="OBII home"><img alt="OBII" src="/images/obii_logo.png" width="750" height="201"/></a><nav class="navlinks"><a href="/how-it-works/">How it works</a><a href="/experts/">Experts</a><a href="/companies/">Companies</a><a href="/pricing/">Pricing</a><a href="/faqs/">FAQs</a></nav><div class="navactions"><a class="signin" href={appLoginUrl}>Log in</a><a class="btn small" href={appRegisterUrl}>Try OBII free for 7 days <span>→</span></a><details class="menu"><summary aria-label="Open menu">☰</summary><div class="menu-panel">{NAV_LINKS.map((link) => <a href={link.href}>{link.label}</a>)}<a href={appLoginUrl}>Log in</a></div></details></div></div></header>
<main>
<section class="hero"><div aria-hidden="true" class="studio-set-mark"><img alt="" src="/images/homepage_inline_asset_1.png"/></div><div class="wrap herowrap"><div class="herocopy"><div class="eyebrow light">OBII  /  EXPERT INVESTMENT INTELLIGENCE</div><h1>Some decisions deserve <span>more than a headline.</span></h1><div class="emotional-hook">You’ve spent years building your portfolio. <strong>Go beyond the headline when researching the shares you own.</strong></div><p class="heroexplain">ausbiz lets you watch expert market interviews for free. OBII is the paid investment intelligence membership that helps you research the shares you follow: discover what real experts said, understand their reasoning and check the original source.</p><div class="heroctas"><a class="btn" href={appRegisterUrl}>Try OBII free for 7 days →</a><a class="btn secondary" href="#story">See a real example ↓</a></div><div class="ctafoot">7 days free · No credit card required · Start with a company you follow</div><div class="heropoints"><span><i class="check">✓</i> Research your shares</span><span><i class="check">✓</i> Real experts, real sources</span><span><i class="check">✓</i> Return every few days</span></div></div><div class="heroart"><div class="hero-glow"></div><div class="portraits"><div class="portrait nadine"><img alt="Actual OBII artwork photograph of Nadine Blayney" src="/images/nadine.jpg"/><div class="portraitlabel"><strong>Nadine Blayney</strong><small>ausbiz · Editorial</small></div></div><div class="portrait koch"><img alt="Actual OBII artwork photograph of David Koch" src="/images/kochie.png"/><div class="portraitlabel"><strong>David “Kochie” Koch</strong><small>ausbiz</small></div></div></div><div class="productwindow"><div class="producttop"><strong>◉ OBII</strong><div class="searchbox">⌕   Search a company or expert</div><span style="font-size:11px;color:#7a82a2">Research</span></div><div class="productbody"><div class="productnav"><div>Home</div><div>Companies</div><div>Experts</div><div>Watchlists</div></div><div class="productmain"><div class="pr-title"><span class="pr-chip">BHP</span><h3>BHP Group</h3><span>ASX:BHP</span></div><div class="pr-headers"><span>Overview</span><span class="active">Expert views</span><span>Sources</span></div><div class="pr-card"><div><strong>Research the original record</strong><p>Find source-linked expert commentary and view the original dated interview.</p></div><div class="pr-video">▷</div></div></div></div></div><div class="phone"><div class="phonescreen"><h5>⌕ Your companies</h5><div class="minirow"><div><b>BHP</b><br/><span>BHP Group</span></div>›</div><div class="minirow"><div><b>CBA</b><br/><span>Commonwealth Bank</span></div>›</div><div class="minirow"><div><b>CSL</b><br/><span>CSL</span></div>›</div><div class="minirow"><div><b>WES</b><br/><span>Wesfarmers</span></div>›</div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="truststrip"><div class="wrap trustinner"><div class="trustsource"><div class="ausbizchip"><img alt="ausbiz broadcaster official logo" src="/images/ausbiz_logo.png"/></div><p>Original market interviews and expert perspectives from ausbiz.</p></div><div class="trustphrase">Hear it on ausbiz. Research it on OBII.</div><div class="trustnumber"><div class="proof-stamp"><strong>REAL</strong><span>experts</span></div><div class="proof-stamp"><strong>DATED</strong><span>sources</span></div><div class="proof-stamp"><strong>YOUR</strong><span>decision</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="story" id="story"><div class="wrap two-col"><div><div class="eyebrow">A REAL EXAMPLE / BHP ON AUSBIZ</div><div class="intro"><h2 class="sectiontitle">You follow BHP. What did the experts say?</h2><p class="bodylarge">On 2 November 2026, ausbiz discussed BHP on the call. OBII is designed to make this kind of commentary easier to research: find a view, explore the available reasoning and check the dated original recording.</p></div><a class="btn" href="#research">Explore the research journey →</a></div><div class="storybox"><div class="storytop" data-episode-player data-src={EPISODE_VIDEO_URL} data-start={EPISODE_START_SECONDS} data-title={EPISODE_TITLE}><div class="titlewave"><span>ORIGINAL AUSBIZ EPISODE · 2 NOV 2026</span><strong>the call</strong></div><button class="round-video" type="button" data-episode-play aria-label={`Play ${EPISODE_TITLE}`}><span aria-hidden="true">▷</span></button><p class="episode-error" data-episode-error role="alert" hidden>Sorry, the video could not be loaded. Please try again.</p></div><div class="storyfoot"><div><h4>BHP Group · ASX:BHP</h4><p>the call · Original ausbiz programme · 2 Nov 2026</p></div></div><div class="story-proof">
<div><span>01 · FIND</span><strong>BHP expert views</strong></div>
<div><span>02 · UNDERSTAND</span><strong>Available reasons &amp; context</strong></div>
<div><span>03 · VERIFY</span><strong>Original clip, dated 2 Nov</strong></div>
</div><div class="source-reassurance">No anonymous stock tips. No invented expert calls. A real programme, the original evidence and your own judgement.</div></div></div></section>
<section class="compare"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">WHY PAY IF AUSBIZ IS FREE?</div><div class="compare-head"><h2 class="sectiontitle">Watch it free.<br/>Research it with OBII.</h2><p class="bodylarge" style="margin-top:14px">ausbiz is where you hear experts for free. OBII is where you research their thinking on the shares you follow, with source-linked commentary, watchlists and tools to help you come back as new views appear.</p></div><div class="compare-grid"><div class="compare-card"><div class="compare-brand">ausbiz</div><div class="labelsmall">FREE TO WATCH</div><h3>Hear what the expert said.</h3><p>Hear market guests discuss shares, market events and investment ideas.</p><ul><li>Original market broadcasts and interviews</li><li>Journalists and guest commentators</li><li>A window into the market conversation</li></ul></div><div class="compare-card paid"><div class="compare-brand purple">OBII</div><div class="labelsmall">PAID RESEARCH MEMBERSHIP</div><h3>Research what it means for you.</h3><p>Find past and new views by company or expert, explore available context, save companies you follow and check the original interview.</p><ul><li>Search by company and named expert</li><li>Dated interview links and available reasoning</li><li>Watchlists, expert follows and research tools by membership tier</li></ul></div></div><p class="comparefooter">You are not paying for the same broadcast again. You are paying for the tools to research it.</p></div></section>
<section class="benefits" id="how"><div class="wrap ben-wrap"><div><div class="eyebrow light">HOW OBII WORKS</div><h2 class="ben-title">Your shares.<br/>Their expertise.<br/>Your decision.</h2></div><div class="bencards"><div class="bencard"><div class="benicon">⌕</div><h4>01. FIND</h4><p>Search real market commentary on the companies and experts you already follow.</p></div><div class="bencard"><div class="benicon">▥</div><h4>02. UNDERSTAND</h4><p>Go beyond a sound bite with the explanation and context available in the research record.</p></div><div class="bencard"><div class="benicon">✓</div><h4>03. VERIFY</h4><p>Check the date and original ausbiz recording before making up your own mind.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="productsection" id="research"><div class="wrap product-layout"><div class="product-stage"><div class="research-card"><div class="research-top"><span>OBII · RESEARCH EXPERIENCE</span><span>Search · Sources</span></div><div class="research-content"><div class="research-input">⌕   Search company or expert     BHP</div><div class="research-result"><div class="researchlogo">BHP</div><div><strong>BHP Group</strong><p>ASX:BHP · Dated expert commentary and original source</p></div></div><div class="research-source"><strong>BHP · From broadcast to research</strong>
<div class="source-trail">
<div><span>FIND</span><b>Original expert commentary</b></div>
