<strong>A reason to return when the market moves.</strong>
<p>Return every few days to check for new commentary on the shares and experts you follow, then go back to the original source.</p></div>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="habit-section"><div class="wrap habit-inner">
<div class="habit-symbol">↻</div><div><div class="eyebrow">A REASON TO KEEP COMING BACK</div><h2>Come back every few days. See what’s new on your shares.</h2><p>The market conversation keeps moving. Drop back in every few days to research fresh expert perspectives on the companies and people you follow, whenever new commentary is available.</p></div><a class="btn" href={appRegisterUrl}>Try OBII free for 7 days →</a>
</div></section>
