<section class="section" id="companies"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">REAL COMPANIES. REAL CONTEXT.</div><div class="intro"><h2 class="sectiontitle">Research begins with a company,<br/>not another headline.</h2><p class="bodylarge">Start with a company you follow. Find dated expert commentary, explore the context and return when new perspectives become available.</p></div><div class="companygrid"><div class="company"><strong>BHP</strong><span>ASX:BHP</span></div><div class="company"><strong>CBA</strong><span>ASX:CBA</span></div><div class="company"><strong>CSL</strong><span>ASX:CSL</span></div><div class="company"><strong>WES</strong><span>ASX:WES</span></div><div class="company"><strong>MQG</strong><span>ASX:MQG</span></div></div><p class="companynote">Company identifiers are examples of recognisable Australian shares, not endorsements, financial recommendations or a guarantee of content coverage.</p></div></section>
<section class="pricing" id="pricing"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">SIMPLE MONTHLY PLANS</div><div class="pricing-head"><h2 class="sectiontitle">Try the intelligence. Decide for yourself.</h2><p class="bodylarge" style="margin-top:14px">See how OBII works for the companies you follow. Start with seven days free and no credit card. Choose Standard or Pro only if the research earns a place in your routine.</p></div><div class="prices"><div class="plan"><h3>Standard</h3><div class="price">A$49.00 <span>/month</span></div><div class="tax">GST added at checkout</div><p class="plandesc">Focused research for a smaller group of companies and market experts.</p><ul><li>One watchlist of up to 10 stocks</li><li>Follow up to 20 experts</li><li>5 playlists and 1 research folder</li><li>Limited Stock Intelligence and Expert Tracker</li><li>9,840 credits each month</li></ul><a class="btn" href={appRegisterUrl}>Try OBII free for 7 days →</a></div><div class="plan featured"><div class="popular">MORE RESEARCH CAPACITY</div><h3>Pro</h3><div class="price">A$149.00 <span>/month</span></div><div class="tax">GST added at checkout</div><p class="plandesc">Greater research capacity, more watchlists and more experts to follow.</p><ul><li>Four watchlists of up to 10 stocks each</li><li>Follow unlimited experts</li><li>15 playlists and 5 research folders</li><li>Full Stock Intelligence and Expert Tracker</li><li>30,000 credits each month</li><li>OBII Insider: a full briefing on any video or expert, matched to your watchlist and experts</li><li>Exclusive news and interviews</li></ul><a class="btn" href={appRegisterUrl}>Try OBII free for 7 days →</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="reassure" id="trial"><div class="wrap"><div class="reassuretop"><div class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU BEGIN</div><h2 class="sectiontitle">Seven days to see if it’s useful to you.</h2><p class="bodylarge" style="margin-top:12px">Explore the product first. Know the terms before choosing to subscribe.</p></div><div class="reassure-grid"><div class="reassure-card"><div class="symbol">◷</div><h4>7 days free</h4><p>Explore the experience before choosing a plan.</p></div><div class="reassure-card"><div class="symbol">▭</div><h4>No card to start</h4><p>No payment details required for the advertised trial.</p></div><div class="reassure-card"><div class="symbol">✓</div><h4>Choose to continue</h4><p>Review features and pricing before subscribing.</p></div><div class="reassure-card"><div class="symbol">◇</div><h4>Your own decision</h4><p>General research information, not personalised advice.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="faq" id="faqs"><div class="wrap faq-layout"><div><div class="eyebrow">COMMON QUESTIONS</div><h2 class="sectiontitle">Everything clear before you begin.</h2><p class="bodylarge" style="margin-top:17px">The more confidently you understand the research experience, the easier your next step should feel.</p></div><div class="faq-list"><details class="faqitem" open><summary><h4>What exactly is OBII? <span aria-hidden="true"></span></h4></summary>
<p>OBII is a paid expert investment intelligence membership. It helps self-directed investors research expert views on companies they follow, explore available reasoning and verify original dated interviews.</p></details><details class="faqitem"><summary><h4>Why would I use OBII month after month? <span aria-hidden="true"></span></h4></summary>
<p>New expert commentary gives you a reason to return to the companies and commentators you follow. Your plan’s research tools help you keep the record organised and inspect new original sources.</p></details><details class="faqitem"><summary><h4>What does the investment intelligence actually do? <span aria-hidden="true"></span></h4></summary>
<p>It organises available expert commentary around companies and people, connects context and source dates, and helps you examine what was said. It does not make investment decisions for you.</p></details><details class="faqitem"><summary><h4>How is it different from free ausbiz? <span aria-hidden="true"></span></h4></summary>
<p>ausbiz lets you watch expert interviews for free. OBII is a paid research membership for searching expert commentary, exploring available reasoning and accessing dated original sources.</p></details><details class="faqitem"><summary><h4>Do I need a card for the trial? <span aria-hidden="true"></span></h4></summary>
<p>No. The advertised seven-day free trial does not require a credit card.</p></details><details class="faqitem"><summary><h4>Does OBII provide personal financial advice? <span aria-hidden="true"></span></h4></summary>
<p>No. OBII provides general expert commentary and source-linked research information, not personalised financial advice.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="finalcta"><div class="wrap final-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow light">REAL PEOPLE. ORIGINAL SOURCES.</div><h2>You’ve done the work to build your portfolio. Make the research count.</h2><p>Find the commentary. Explore the thinking. Check the original source.</p></div><div><a class="btn" href={appRegisterUrl}>Try OBII free for 7 days <span>→</span></a><div class="ctafoot">No credit card required to start.</div></div></div></section>
